      "term": "Moss stitch",
      "definition": "Also called granite stitch or linen stitch. A repeat of sc, ch-1, skip 1. Works into ch-1 spaces on return rows to create a tight tweedy texture."
    },
    {
      "slug": "stitch-repeat-g85",
      "term": "Stitch repeat",
      "definition": "The number of stitches that form one complete pattern unit. In moss stitch the repeat is 2: one sc and one ch-1 space. The starting chain must be a multiple of the repeat."
    }
